The Linux ELF backend (agent-overflow-linux) is dropped here at build time
by `task common:windows:build`. The cmd/agent-overflow-windows main.go
embeds it via //go:embed payload/agent-overflow-linux.

If this directory is empty when you run `go build ./cmd/agent-overflow-windows`,
the embed directive falls back to a placeholder file (see embed_placeholder.txt
in the same directory) so the build still succeeds; the launcher errors at
runtime when it tries to install the payload.
